  <!-- EN: Specialized warcasket helmet with superior protection and worse weight, fitted with a respirator that keeps out tox gas and draws it back into the tank.\n\nThe 7th generation warcaskets came after underwhelming results in improving the baseline performance even further, instead focusing on creating designs that - while interchangeable - work better as a set. They were also the first to include plasteel in the design as it appeared more frequently in scavenging and looting. Each piece has a unique function that synergizes with those of the same series, making them a truly separate class of mobile armor units.\n\nThe Toxin series is based on the Cataphract design, with the frame rebuilt around a tox gas tank for chemical warfare. The tank in the shell feeds vents around the pilot and the gas jets on the pauldrons, and the respirator in the helmet draws gas back into it. The objective was a pilot who could gas a position and then walk into it, and clear the air again once the fighting was done. Together the pieces make the pilot immune to environmental toxins. -->
  <TXWC_WarcasketHelmet_Toxin.description>特化型戰棺頭盔，在增加機體重量的同時大幅提升了防護性。配備呼吸器，可阻擋毒氣，並將毒氣吸回毒氣罐。\n\n由於機體基本性能的強化陷入瓶頸，第七代戰棺的研發重心轉向了創新改進。雖然機體部件仍可自由搭配，但配套組裝顯然才是最佳選擇，同型號部件間的協作增效使它們真正成為了功能分明的機動裝甲部隊。第七代也是首批採用塑鋼的戰棺，因為在拾荒與劫掠時總能取得大量這種材料。\n\n毒素型以騎士型的設計為基礎，機體圍繞毒氣罐重新打造，專為化學戰爭而生。外殼內的毒氣罐為駕駛員周圍的排氣口與護肩上的噴射口供氣，頭盔的呼吸器則將毒氣吸回罐中。設計目標是讓駕駛員先用毒氣壓制陣地，再走進去，並在戰鬥結束後重新淨化空氣。整套部件讓駕駛員對環境毒素免疫。</TXWC_WarcasketHelmet_Toxin.description>
  <!-- EN: toxin warcasket helmet -->
  <TXWC_WarcasketHelmet_Toxin.label>毒素型戰棺頭盔</TXWC_WarcasketHelmet_Toxin.label>
  <!-- EN: Specialized warcasket helmet with superior protection and worse weight, fitted with a respirator that keeps out tox gas and draws it back into the tank. -->
